         <change when="2026-03-30T13:03:08-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/Mike%20Sampson">Vote - Accept-Straight-to-Finalization - Looks good. The ed. pr. notes the diairesis on ἵζομεν (r. 4) and the apostrophe in v. 5 ("Elisionshaken im Papyrus"). It does not account for the apostrophe on r. 4. It also indicates that a trace at the top of the recto is not transcribed ("eine geringfügige, nicht identifizierbare Spur der vorausgehenden Zeile ist nicht berücksichtigt") so we must add a new line 1 (1. [.?].1[.?]) and renumber the remaining lines. Review metadata before finalization.</change>
